  modules) and EncB.Emit. EncB/EarlyWarning.lean is not imported by EncB and not built; its own guard covers EncB.EW.main ([propext]).
  command: systemd-run --user --scope -q -p MemoryMax=8G -p MemorySwapMax=0 nice -n 10 lake env lean logs/axioms_enum.lean.txt   (rc=0, 6.85 s 1119768 KB)
query 2 (logs/axioms_query.lean.txt, regenerated): '#print axioms' on each of the 425 named declarations that query 1 lists, in its order.
  command: systemd-run --user --scope -q -p MemoryMax=8G -p MemorySwapMax=0 nice -n 10 lake env lean logs/axioms_query.lean.txt  (rc=0, 3.02 s 368008 KB)
  Both were first run on scratch copies of the same text; the reruns from logs/ printed byte-identical output.
